WEBVTT

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:20.040
Rental Magica

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:45.730
And that is my report on Goetia's achievements.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.600
There seem to be some complaints.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.840
Please tell me what they are.

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:58.440
We appreciate your abilities, Miss Adelicia.

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:01.750
But isn't it another thing entirely...

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.890
...when looking at Goetia's
recent run of misfortune?

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:07.080
You mean Clive and Gara, don't you?

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:11.350
But that shouldn't have caused us any
disadvantage with The Association.

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:15.920
You can't keep concerning yourself
with tiny societies like Astral.

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:18.230
You should rethink your position and-

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:21.830
Goetia's success rate in landing
bids hasn't gone down!

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:31.280
Even if leadership in a magical
association is hereditary,

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:33.340
you're still too young, Miss Adelicia.

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:36.480
You're immature, not even married yet.

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:40.120
Are you saying I should marry?

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:42.990
If you don't want to,
you can always get the leader...

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:45.090
...of another association to be your acting leader.

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:49.790
You can also combine looking for those
with suitable power with finding a fiancé

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:52.870
Considering the balance between associations,

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:56.400
how about Saiid il-Tarib of the
Apprentice of the Mountain group?

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.430
I trust they'd have no objections.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.660
What say you?

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:04.570
That won't be necessary.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:07.740
I've already decided on a person.

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:13.190
Episode 21
THE WHITE AND BLACK DRESSES

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:34.540
Big Sister Adelicia!

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:38.480
Good timing. I just brewed some tea...

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:46.410
In other words, the union of
both gives rise to a new element.

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:49.160
Now, this can be used in a variety of ways...

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:52.180
So, to explain what it has
to do with this magic...

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.620
We're in the middle of studying!

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.060
Boss, you're studying.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.100
What's wrong, Adelicia?

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:02.560
Can we help you?

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.410
Trying to disturb our business again?

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.670
I don't mean to, but...

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:11.350
But I was hoping that maybe you could...

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:14.610
...hear this selfish request from me...

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:18.390
What's up?

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:20.180
Now you've got me all stressed out.

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:33.260
W-Would you...

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:40.100
Would you please marry me?!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:51.780
Honami?

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:53.190
Yes?

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.560
You're not kidding?

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:57.420
I'm serious.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.780
Oh, I see!

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:06.060
What?!

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:11.590
Big Sister Honami marry
Big Sister Adelicia?

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:15.870
Marry?

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.310
Are you okay?

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:25.850
In an case, I am making a
formal request to Astral.

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:30.850
Please allow me to hire Honami
Takase Ambler as a Rental Magica.

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:33.260
H-Hold on here!

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:34.400
What do you mean "marry"?

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:37.960
Marriages are, at their root,
a type of magical ceremony.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:40.230
For example, to utilize the power of sacred land,

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:43.530
you would marry the god of that land.

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:46.570
In the same vein, the ceremony known
as marriage allows for a rebirth of sorts,

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:50.340
with the effect of releasing the
participants from curses or bindings.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:52.810
That's not what I meant!

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:55.550
In the case of ancient magical associations,

00:05:55.550 --> 00:06:01.190
a mage's marriage would also
mark their having come of age.

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.360
Let me guess...

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.050
Pressure from The Association, right?

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:11.290
It's been a year since Adelicia
took over as head of Goetia.

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:15.400
It's nearly time for the reborn
Goetia to receive its new rating.

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:18.000
Did this item come up at the regular meeting?

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:19.630
Regular meeting?

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:22.340
I heard it's this crazily dangerous meeting...

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:25.110
...where all the leaders of the
magical associations gather.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:30.880
Right now, Goetia is in an
extremely precarious situation.

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:34.680
As its leader, I have to get through
this emergency in any way that I can.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.950
God, this is so annoying!

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:43.260
There, there. No need to be afraid...

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:46.630
Your fur's going to fall out from sheer terror.

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:51.370
A cat's fur is more precious than gold,
diamonds, or orichalcum.

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:53.940
And that's why you're getting married?

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:56.070
Yeah, pretty much.

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:59.050
But why are we talking marriage here?

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:00.670
This is a fine proposal.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.210
But why marry Big Sister Honami?

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:06.410
A mage has to marry another mage.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:11.220
I couldn't think of anyone else equal to me.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:15.860
Besides, marrying another girl avoids
any unnecessary misunderstandings.

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:21.900
It's not at all uncommon for women
to marry in the magical world.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.140
For example, there's a magical
association in San Francisco...

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:30.910
...which encourages its female members to marry
each other in order to use stronger magic.

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:33.280
If we do this as a magical ceremony,

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:36.380
we won't have to live as a married couple, right?

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:37.740
Of course.

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:39.540
Sure. Okay, then.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:42.590
They're getting married! They're getting married!

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:45.420
Yay! My big sisters are getting married!

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:47.300
I wonder what I should wear.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.260
We have all sorts of preparations to make.

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:51.430
Maybe something white...

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:52.170
Um, excuse me!
Maybe something white...

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:53.290
Um, excuse me!

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:57.200
Yay! This'll be so much fun! Yay! Yay!

00:07:58.210 --> 00:07:59.100
Everyone!

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.370
As your president, I order you!

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:09.880
Sorry, I just wanted you guys to listen to me.

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.750
To be honest, I don't really get this.

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:15.590
How can Honami and Adelicia
be getting married?

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:17.850
This is simply a magical rite!

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:21.160
Please don't think of it as a real marriage.

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.190
Exactly.

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:27.100
A magical marriage is nothing like a regular one!

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:30.940
You can just consider this
marriage to be entirely symbolic.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.570
As soon as the ceremony is acknowledged,

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:34.510
we can get divorced.

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:37.040
Right, but...

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:42.950
Boss, if The Association deems
Adelicia unfit to lead Goetia,

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:45.510
it'll have repercussions for Astral as well.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:46.280
Huh?

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:48.320
Addie is a shareholder in our company.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:52.360
If someone besides her takes over Goetia,

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.660
they could easily crush us.

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:56.320
I see.

00:08:56.860 --> 00:08:59.230
Like or dislike has nothing to do with this.

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:01.670
This is just a mages' marriage.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.940
A mages' marriage.

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:08.700
We should be delighted with the
opportunities this opens for our company.

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.540
Now Boss, cut this out and try to understand.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:12.770
Right...

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:15.250
Now then, we need to set a
date for the ceremony quickly.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.510
Yay!

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:19.120
I think this should be the day.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.890
Lucky seven would be nice.

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:22.720
The Japanese are inconsistent
in setting these things.

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:24.690
Oh, this is a lucky day!

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:25.730
I'm not available on this week.

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:27.520
Is this a good idea?
I'm not available on this week.

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:29.230
How wonderful!

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:32.200
To be able to help Goetia with a wedding.

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:34.860
Now that we know what's needed,
let's look at the items at once.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:38.570
You need items symbolic of
the sun and the moon, right?

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:39.740
Right.

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:42.580
Witchcraft is based on the moon,

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:45.610
as opposed to Solomonic magic,
which is the magic of kings,

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:47.980
so the sun is most appropriate to symbolize that.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.080
I have no objections.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:54.280
If I may make a request,
I'd prefer to wear symbols of gold.

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.920
I have just the thing.

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:08.730
Medieval European, made for noble sisters.

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:13.040
Ultimately never used,
due to various circumstances...

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:16.770
Now then, who wants to try on which dress?

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:19.210
White and black...

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:21.110
They're both beautiful.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:22.450
Now look...

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.550
You're actually getting married?

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:26.110
Oh, now what's your problem?

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.780
Itsuki, please choose for us.

00:10:29.890 --> 00:10:32.480
As president, you can help us out that much.

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:34.260
But...

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:36.460
President Iba, please.

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.030
Let's see...

00:10:46.510 --> 00:10:50.170
Maybe Adelicia in the white
and Honami in the black.

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:55.180
I just think Adelicia's hair would
go with that one's material.

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:59.840
And I thought the black one would
bring out Honami's eyes best...

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:03.420
Well...

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:04.560
That's that.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.030
Order noted.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:10.760
Oh, you'll need rings as well
as dresses, won't you?

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:29.910
It's just a ceremony, but...

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:33.150
Its only meaning will be magical, but...

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:34.810
But still...
But still...

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:40.650
That's girls for you.

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:43.930
Like or dislike has nothing to do with this.

00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:46.860
This is just a mages' marriage.

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:51.960
I wonder about that.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:03.280
I'll be performing the ceremony today.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:05.270
I look forward to working with you.

00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:07.490
We look forward to working with you.

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:33.840
What does Icchan think of this?

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:48.450
I wonder what Itsuki thinks of this?

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:54.560
Miss Adelicia, are you sure about this?

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:57.730
I'm doing this for Goetia.

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:24.060
It... It suits you, Addie.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:27.700
Yeah, yours looks good on you, Honami.

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:29.370
Come to think of it,

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.700
you've always had a weakness for
cute stuff, haven't you, Addie?

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:35.910
Like lace and frills and stuffed toys...

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:39.170
Although you hardly ever show it.

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:41.980
All you ever do is bring
up useless stuff like that!

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:44.510
No, it just suddenly occurred to me...

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.820
You really are a girl, aren't you?

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:48.020
You're one to talk!

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:50.680
Looking that good in a wedding dress...

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:52.990
You're pretty girly too, aren't you?

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:06.100
Don't forget, we're just getting married as mages.

00:14:06.410 --> 00:14:10.670
Of course. Only as mages.

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:59.890
By the grace of the supreme,

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:05.570
we are gathered here today to join Adelicia
Lenn Mathers and Honami Takase Ambler...

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:07.560
...in the bonds of holy matrimony.

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:10.830
Let them both establish the proof
of this joining of themselves.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:14.680
The gold ring symbolizes King Solomon,

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:17.080
while the iron ring symbolizes the Celts,

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.010
demonstrating the true natures of both.

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:25.480
I'm establishing a path between them.

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:27.640
Please don't move.

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:28.790
Understood.

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:39.790
Addie... I told you not to take this so seriously.

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:42.900
I-If I did it too jokingly,
it'd be more of a problem!

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:45.870
By the light of the supreme one,

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:48.310
I pledge myself to this sister of a foreign land.

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:51.810
Grant her blessings, victory, and power.

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:10.630
I beg you, by this ring of iron,

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:13.330
bless this queen of Solomon.

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:23.840
So, this is a ceremony for mages, huh?

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:25.400
It's a ceremony...

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:27.980
Just a ceremony...

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.540
This has nothing to do with like or dislike.

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:33.090
Feelings have nothing to do with it.

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:34.950
As mages!

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:36.950
As mages!

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:39.250
But is that really how it is?

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:40.590
After all...

00:16:55.980 --> 00:17:00.470
The exchange of wedding rings is the
ceremony that links the two of them.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:03.950
In short, they are joined heart to heart.

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:05.780
Heart to heart?

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:17.430
They share their joys and sorrows.

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:21.700
They now share the innermost
secrets of their hearts...

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:24.140
...which they would never confess to anyone.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:27.270
Like I thought,

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.400
this isn't just a marriage in form only.

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:32.480
It's important to protect
your heart's secrets, isn't it?

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:35.080
That's strange.

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:38.320
Normally in this sort of ceremony,

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:40.480
they would be magically uplifted.

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:44.950
They should be overflowing in
an aura of joy and delight.

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:17.460
Addie! Addie!

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:22.720
Addie!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.490
Addie, are you sure about this?

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:31.070
Doing this in front of Icchan?

00:18:33.470 --> 00:18:34.670
I...

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:49.110
This isn't right!

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:50.050
Itsuki?

00:18:50.390 --> 00:18:51.050
Stop this!

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:52.120
Mr. President?

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:54.760
You shouldn't be doing this!

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:03.770
Itsuki?

00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:04.600
Icchan?

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:25.660
They're gone.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.490
Did he just run off with both brides?

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:30.720
The new president is quite bold.

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:36.600
What's the big idea?!

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:38.130
You wrecked the ceremony!

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:40.330
Itsuki! This is unforgivable!

00:19:54.990 --> 00:19:58.290
Boss, why do you keep meddling in things?

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:01.560
You don't understand magic, and yet...

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:07.670
Even if I don't understand magic,
I understand you two.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:13.740
Nevermind the ceremony or being mages.

00:20:14.470 --> 00:20:16.740
This isn't like either of you.

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:20.980
When your opponent is great, you're greater.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:22.740
When he's strong, you're stronger.

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:25.550
You'd slap him right in the face.

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:26.880
That's you, right, Adelicia?

00:20:36.730 --> 00:20:37.460
Connect!

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:42.960
Well, who would it be,
but Miss Adelicia of Goetia.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:45.860
It's about the marriage I told you of before.

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:48.940
So, the preparations have been made?

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:50.880
I'm calling it off.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:51.540
Wha?!

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:54.110
Miss, what do you?!

00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:56.780
I'll send you the details later.

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:58.280
If you'll excuse me.

00:20:58.820 --> 00:20:59.580
Wait!

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:02.520
That felt good.

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:05.860
If I want to prove Goetia's dignity,

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:09.450
I can get it by getting double or triple
the achievements of those people.

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:14.030
I don't need a wedding to do that.

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:15.970
That's all there is to it.

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:20.070
And so, we don't need these anymore.

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:21.730
Yeah.

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:46.960
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:55.700
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:21:56.540 --> 00:22:08.250
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:20.170
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:20.170 --> 00:22:26.540
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:30.910
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:31.810 --> 00:22:35.220
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:35.220 --> 00:22:40.210
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:52.360
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:22:52.530 --> 00:22:56.200
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:22:56.200 --> 00:23:00.330
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:00.570 --> 00:23:04.480
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:23:07.410 --> 00:23:10.940
Itsuki, it was a little more to the left.

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:15.140
Boss! Mine went further out. Further!

00:23:21.090 --> 00:23:24.090
If I don't find them, how will
we get our money back?

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:27.600
WEDDING [KEKKONSHIKl]

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:28.590
WEDDING [KEKKONSHIKl]
Well, which?
Well, which?

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:29.240
Huh?

00:23:29.470 --> 00:23:30.870
I said, which one?!
I said, which one?!

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:33.400
Um, I'm not sure what you're asking me...

00:23:34.570 --> 00:23:36.630
Prof. Miwa, punishment!
Prof. Miwa, punishment!

